From: Pear contributors
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: publish native PE images through one owned page-W^X arena

Original Pear integration against Wine 4e819f054dd2d9ee855ee3f1e30d8c1bb8f80fcf
with preceding ordered Pear patches. Retain Wine view and server ownership;
stage and relocate checked ARM64 PE images in native code, publish immutable
code RX, keep ordinary data non-executable and retire actual mappings before
compatible bounded reuse. Never request RWX or a competing JIT allocation.
The native prerequisite is separate evidence, not Wine/game qualification.
Existing Wine modifications retain LGPL-2.1-or-later notices. New original
pear_pe_arena.c/.h retain their MIT notices; no Pear-wide license is selected.

